<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish equity, bond turnover up in January - ISE.</title>
<headline>Irish equity, bond turnover up in January - ISE.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover on the official list of the Irish Stock Exchange was 943.6 million Irish pounds in January, up from 533.2 million in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Official figures released on Monday showed that turnover on the Irish government bond market rose to 14.87 billion Irish pounds from 12.28 billion a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
